sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as SCR-01 Login UI
    participant API as AuthController (proposed)
    participant Auth as AuthService (Vinh-owned)
    participant DB as Prisma/PostgreSQL
    User->>UI: Enter username and password
    UI->>API: POST /api/auth/login (PROVISIONAL route)
    API->>Auth: login(credentials) (verify actual method)
    Auth->>DB: Look up User, password hash and isActive
    DB-->>Auth: User account or not found
    alt Invalid credentials
        Auth-->>API: INVALID_CREDENTIALS
        API-->>UI: 401 {error:{code,message}}
        UI-->>User: Show generic credential error
    else Account inactive
        Auth-->>API: ACCOUNT_INACTIVE (code TBD)
        API-->>UI: 403/422 (TBD per Vinh contract)
        UI-->>User: Explain inactive account
    else Valid active account
        Auth->>Auth: Verify bcrypt hash; sign JWT with sub and role
        Auth-->>API: JWT and safe User profile
        API-->>UI: 200 token and profile (shape TBD)
        UI->>UI: Store session token
        UI-->>User: Navigate to authorized role landing screen
    end
